{"hymn":"S444","parent":"E563","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"¡Morando en Ti!, en Tu profundo amor","subtitle":"Experiencia de Cristo—Permaneced en Él","syl":{"n1":["¡Mo","i"],"n2":["ran","m"],"n3":["do‿en","t"],"n4":"Ti!,","n5":"en","n6":"Tu","n7":["pro","i"],"n8":["fun","m"],"n9":["do‿a","m"],"n10":["mor,","t"],"n11":["Se","i"],"n12":["ñor","t"],"n13":["Je","i"],"n14":["sús,","t"],"n15":["Cor","i"],"n16":["de","m"],"n17":["ro","t"],"n18":"de","n19":"mi","n20":"Dios;","n21":"Cual","n22":["ra","i"],"n23":["ma‿y","t"],"n24":["ár","i"],"n25":["bol","t"],"n26":"en","n27":["u","i"],"n28":["nión","t"],"n29":["vi","i"],"n30":["tal,","t"],"n31":["Quie","i"],"n32":["ro,","t"],"n33":"mi","n34":"buen","n35":["Se","i"],"n36":["ñor,","t"],"n37":"en","n38":"Ti","n39":["mo","i"],"n40":["rar.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["¡Morando en Ti!, mi Salvador yo sé","Cómo Tu vasto amor se verterá;","Así mi vaso rebosando en Ti","Con inefable gozo fluirá."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["¡Morando en Ti!, ni el ego ni el mal","Podrán Tu vida interna subyugar;","Mi alma, unida a Ti en comunión,","Sólo anhela estar en sumisión."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["¡Morando en Ti!, yo puedo entender,","Hoy los secretos de Tu corazón;","Paz, gozo y Tu Palabra conocer,","Sirviendo a Dios con fruto y poder."]}]}